        "en": "While holding the \"Faces of Elation\" state, Aeon ★ Aha enables allies' Path of Elation to ascend, and enhances Punchline and \"Certified Banger\" into Bliss and \"Party Trick,\" respectively. Bliss recovers #1[i]% of its consumed amount when Aha Instant ends. During \"Faces of Elation,\" Aeon ★ Aha's CRIT Rate increases by #3[i]%, and the DMG dealt ignores #2[i]% of the enemy target's DEF.",
